{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10415","headline":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 十一 · 高适","name":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我行倦风湍，辍棹将问津。\n空传歌瓠子，感慨独愁人。\n孟夏桑叶肥，穠阴夹长津。\n蚕农有时节，田野无闲人。\n临水狎渔樵，望山怀隐沦。\n谁能去京洛，顦顇对风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}